---
layout: base.njk
title: Magazin
permalink: /magazin/
description: Toate produsele din magazin - gadgeturi, accesorii si produse smart, in stoc, cu livrare rapida in Romania.
---
<section class="wrap page-head">
  <h1>Magazin</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ collections.products.length }} produse in stoc · livrare 24-48h</p>
  <div class="cat-chips">
    <a class="chip active" href="/magazin/">Toate</a>
    {% for cat in collections.categories %}
    <a class="chip" href="/categorie/{{ cat | slug }}/">{{ cat }}</a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="product-cards">
    {% for p in collections.products %}
    {% include "card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
